TV Janitor uses two things from CleanYourTV (https://github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv):

1. The bundled home screen: CleanYourTV's launcher, built from source at a pinned commit
   with patches/cleanyourtv-launcher.patch applied (a modified version).
2. The hint base: app/src/main/assets/community.tsv and devices.tsv are derived from
   CleanYourTV's examples/*/debloat.txt, and the app can refresh them from the same files.

